  <CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Display>표시</CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Display>
  <CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Trees>연구 트리</CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Trees>
  <CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Debug>문제 해결</CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Debug>
  <CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Gameplay>어떤 프로젝트가 제공되는지</CM_Semi_Random_Research_Setting_Section_Gameplay>
